Subject: [PATCH] Match the image loader's return type in paste handlers

load_image is defined in mfsk-pic.cxx and declared as an mfsk friend with
an int return type. Match that signature in the WEFAX and picture-widget
paste handlers to avoid a One Definition Rule violation during LTO linking.

--- a/src/wefax/wefax_map.cxx
+++ b/src/wefax/wefax_map.cxx
@@ -749 +749 @@
-	extern void load_image(const char*);
+	extern int load_image(const char*);
--- a/src/widgets/picture.cxx
+++ b/src/widgets/picture.cxx
@@ -866 +866 @@
-	extern void load_image(const char*);
+	extern int load_image(const char*);
